gments (through centroid intersection).\n\nTherefore, the calculation logic revealed acute or obtuse sequences for segments figuring out their sum. The lowest possible count will orient measuring identifying square-intersecting angles uniquely. \n\nThe maximum number of acute angles is actually \\(0\\). \\(\\boxed{0}\\)",
